<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-Oct budget deficit down at HUF 75.5bln.</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-Oct budget deficit down at HUF 75.5bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The accumulated deficit of Hungary's central state budget was 75.5 billion forints for January-October of 1996, down from 214.5 billion forints in the same period last year, the Finance Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BUDGET (bln forints) Jan-Oct 96 Jan-Sept 96  Jan-Oct 95</p>
<p>    REVENUES		  1,603.9    1,397.7	 n.a.</p>
<p>    EXPENDITURES	    1,679.4    1,512.5	 n.a.</p>
<p>    BALANCE		    - 75.5    - 114.8	- 214.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The budget deficit target for 1996 is 232.9 billion forints. The figures do not include one-off revenues, e.g. privatisation revenues. -- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
